/*
 * Default page template.
 *
 * The Theme Access token cannot assign template suffixes to pages — that needs
 * the Admin API — so every page on this store renders through THIS template.
 * It therefore carries one section per page, each gated on `page_handle`, plus
 * a generic fallback last for any page not listed.
 *
 * The matching page.<handle>.json files are still on disk. Assign one of them
 * in Online Store > Pages > Theme template and it takes over; then the entry
 * here can be deleted. Nothing breaks either way.
 */
